      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_39fb6625808958c87da5",
      "document_start": 117,
      "document_end": 186,
      "text": "在计算力换算系数时，应注意传动效率要考虑构件间摩擦损耗的影响，仅考虑传动过程中因约束非理想由约束反力引起的摩擦损耗，而不是全部的摩擦损耗；",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_e7aa0599e18b1858e725",
      "document_start": 186,
      "document_end": 225,
      "text": "由外力引起的导轨反力所产生的摩擦力属外力，不计入传动效率，而只在外合力中考虑。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_dbc3bfc56ce5d3dcc1a9",
      "document_start": 227,
      "document_end": 247,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_15de3b7ebd34d870cd16",
      "document_start": 248,
      "document_end": 267,
      "text": "# 五、连接件的转动到自身平动的模数;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_858f00ebaf3c255e1d38",
      "document_start": 268,
      "document_end": 300,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0ba30eb4a0fb7a421666",
      "document_start": 302,
      "document_end": 369,
      "text": "离合器开始分离时由于活塞顶杆推力的作用使得鼓形轮被制动，而连接件由拨弹齿轮带动继续转动的同时，在螺旋线结构的作用下被强制旋入鼓形轮中。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ee719be8b74e14e1ae1f",
      "document_start": 369,
      "document_end": 403,
      "text": "连接件的最终运动为轴向方向的平动与周向方向的转动复合而成的螺旋运动。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2d89bf3be9801937b5ea",
      "document_start": 403,
      "document_end": 449,
      "text": "当连接件与拨弹齿轮分离后，连接件则由于惯性继续做螺旋运动而旋入鼓形轮直到与支撑体啮合、制动。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_68d8e88e01e84f5186b5",
      "document_start": 449,
      "document_end": 474,
      "text": "下面将分析这一过程中连接件的转动到自身平动的模数。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7f0865c311cd812a05bd",
      "document_start": 476,
      "document_end": 496,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_56cdab8e2521f6ee6df9",
      "document_start": 497,
      "document_end": 517,
      "text": "# 4.2.1 滚柱凸轮机构的数学描述;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_450278960cb3d463a5e6",
      "document_start": 518,
      "document_end": 550,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a3e4f6bf2299079b22fb",
      "document_start": 552,
      "document_end": 614,
      "text": "在自动机中, 大量的动作是通过构件间的直接作用来完成的, 这种构件间的运动关系的传递在键合图模型中, 就体现为转换器的模数。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_220c6ffb9c6fe36be21a",
      "document_start": 614,
      "document_end": 673,
      "text": "与普通机械系统中的定速比传递机构不同, 其模数 (在此等效于速比) 往往是系统状态空间变量的函数, 因此都可以把它们视",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_521297a90da91a6dfb6d",
      "document_start": 675,
      "document_end": 695,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8940b9b750ced7b192ea",
      "document_start": 696,
      "document_end": 700,
      "text": "# 2.",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_82a8ccbd2ead80412787",
      "document_start": 701,
      "document_end": 708,
      "text": "简谐运动规律;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2da3232aa9195ae93480",
      "document_start": 709,
      "document_end": 741,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b2474bc6adda4368fd7e",
      "document_start": 743,
      "document_end": 776,
      "text": "当质点在圆周上做匀速运动时，它在直径上的投影点的运动即为简谐运动。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_cae86f4da66ac543c2f3",
      "document_start": 776,
      "document_end": 809,
      "text": "从动件做简谐运动时，其加速度按余弦规律变化，故又称余弦加速度规律。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6f8bdc9ff92d895091e1",
      "document_start": 809,
      "document_end": 852,
      "text": "由运动线图（图4.2.4）可见，在行程开始和终止位置，加速度有突变，也会引起柔性冲击。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_14185cce4cb9f98cfcca",
      "document_start": 852,
      "document_end": 893,
      "text": "只有当远、近休止角均为零时，才可以获得连续的加速度曲线（图4.2.4中虚线所示）。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b70cde3b340a0ac90843",
      "document_start": 895,
      "document_end": 915,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f71f34e39ae78e100ace",
      "document_start": 916,
      "document_end": 920,
      "text": "# 4.",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f873f6a0f87d5ce306c9",
      "document_start": 921,
      "document_end": 943,
      "text": "正弦加速度（摆线）运动规律（图4.2.6）;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_33c1989b656026991a45",
      "document_start": 944,
      "document_end": 976,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_15d4645d524f7c64804b",
      "document_start": 978,
      "document_end": 1072,
      "text": "这种运动规律，其位移3-4-5次多项式运动规律整个推程运动过程中的速度和加速度曲线都是连续变化的，加速度没有任何突变，因此不会产生惯性力的突变，既无刚性冲击也无柔性冲击，可应用于高速凸轮。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ceefbe0530eaa49acddc",
      "document_start": 1074,
      "document_end": 1094,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7cf304f83c7b82b1daa0",
      "document_start": 1095,
      "document_end": 1099,
      "text": "# 1.",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_116542e16f379805226d",
      "document_start": 1100,
      "document_end": 1112,
      "text": "确定从动件运动规律曲线;",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0eca903d7e670d8376bb",
      "document_start": 1113,
      "document_end": 1145,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_55bdabfe4ea9bca8fe9f",
      "document_start": 1147,
      "document_end": 1189,
      "text": "对于选用的运动规律曲线必须要保证速度曲线没有突变，确保从动件运动过程中没有刚性冲击。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2efa071e742c102e8ec2",
      "document_start": 1189,
      "document_end": 1308,
      "text": "其次是从加速度曲线进行考虑，尽量消除柔性冲击，这应该从加速度的高一阶导数进行考虑，保证该导数的曲线没有突变，以确保因加速运动引起的振动和运动结束后系统余振在要求的范围内，如正弦加速度运动，因为其加速度导数存在突变，其高速运动性能并不理想。",
      "section_id": "section_34a9d64f5b14"
    }
